     A*  WORKERS' COMP BR-7 CODE TABLE FILE
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Revisions:                                                    *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 06/08/01 C:15  Project: 114WBY                                *
     A*                Added a field which will designate certain     *
     A*                codes to be used for Common Wealth processing  *
     A*                only.                                          *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PB701                     TEXT('BR-7 CODE TABLE FILE')
     A            B7CO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            B7KEY     R               REFFLD(KEY)
     A            B7DESC    R               REFFLD(DS30)
     A            B7LTLF    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('LOST TIME' 'FLAG')
     A            B7STAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            B7USER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            B7PGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            B7TIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            B7DT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
     A            B7STFL    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('SETTLEMENT FLAG')
     A*** Begin add *** 06/08/01 **************************************
     A            B7RSTR    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('CW usage only')
     A*** End add ***** 06/08/01 **************************************
